# Seiche's speed dial (physics catalog plan, 2026-10-03): fast-forward under
# the frame budget. tree.html?nodes=300&seed=7&links=none&gpu=off&physics_speed=50
# is too large for fifty CPU ticks inside the default 8 ms budget, so the
# budget binds, the canvas reports the speed it reached, and stepping stays
# inside the budget. p6_tree_speed_fast_control is the same at 24 nodes.
assert snap ready == true
assert snap physics-speed == 50
assert snap physics-budget-us == 8000
click role:button Play physics
settle 2
assert snap physics-paused == false
click role:combobox Arrangement
settle 1
click role:option Free (physics alone)
settle 1
click role:button Apply arrangement
settle 1
assert snap layout == free
settle 10
timing start speed-fast
settle 30
timing stop
log-physics fast
assert snap physics-budget-bound == true
assert snap physics-owed-steps >= 40
assert snap physics-effective-speed >= 1
assert snap physics-effective-speed <= 25
assert snap pace-frames == 30
assert snap pace-compute-max-us <= 8000
assert snap finite == true
log p6 speed fast receipt complete
